Product Requirement Document (PRD): Maariful Quran Interactive Reader
Status: Approved for Implementation
Author: AI Principal Architect & Solution Lead
Target Execution Agent: Senior Full-Stack Engineer / Autonomous Implementation Agent


1. Executive Summary & Core Objective
Problem Statement
Maariful Quran (by Mufti Muhammad Shafi) is a monumental 8-volume Islamic exegesis. Current digital formats are restricted to cumbersome multi-thousand-page PDFs or legacy web platforms suffering from poor searchability, disjointed verse grouping, unrefined Arabic typography, and severe browser lag when loading lengthy chapters.


Target Value Proposition
A lightning-fast, static, React-based desktop web reader that organizes the tafseer into thematic sections. It pairs the official King Fahd Complex Arabic script with English commentary, offering dual view modes (Standard Block and Combined phrase-by-phrase), curated vocabulary popovers, and an eye-comfort reading palette.


Success Criteria
* Initial page load to interactive read state in under 350ms.
* Maintain 60fps continuous scrolling with 0ms visual stutter on massive chapters (e.g., Surah Al-Baqarah's 286 verses).
* 100% accurate rendering of Uthmanic Medina script ligatures and diacritics via KFGQPC web fonts.


