3. Explicit Boundaries & Non-Goals
In-Scope (Must Have)
* 2-Pane UI: Left navigation tree (Surahs 1–114, Ajza' 1–30, thematic section accordions) + Right continuous reading canvas.
* Typography: Web font integration for KFGQPC Uthmanic Script HAFS.
* Dual Display Modes: Instant toggle between Block View (traditional Mushaf block + translation) and Combined View (Quranic-style stacked phrase-by-phrase cards).
* Curated Term Definitions: Dotted underline on high-impact theological/legal terms with popover tooltip (hover on desktop, tap on mobile).
* Sub-Section Margin Accents: Visual accent borders and pill tags for Injunctions & Rulings (Ahkam), Occasion of Revelation (Asbab al-Nuzul), and Key Insights.
* Eye-Comfort Themes: Warm cream parchment (#F8F7F4) and slate charcoal (#18181A) with a spring-sliding pill switch.
* Performance Optimization: Use native CSS content-visibility: auto to prevent DOM bloat on massive chapters.
* State Management: React Query (TanStack Query) for fetching and caching chunked Surah JSON files.


Explicit Non-Goals (Strictly Out of Scope for V1)
* Audio recitation playback or verse-sync audio trackers.
* User accounts, server databases, cloud synchronization, or social commenting systems.
* Dynamic font size adjustment sliders (typography sizes and line heights are fixed to optimal defaults).
* React Virtualization (windowing) for the reading pane (rejected to preserve native browser Ctrl+F search).


