5. Technical Stack & Implementation Contracts
* Core Framework: React (via Vite or Next.js static export).
* Styling: Tailwind CSS.
* UI Primitives: Radix UI or shadcn/ui (for accessible tooltips/popovers and accordion trees).
* Data Fetching: @tanstack/react-query to fetch static JSON files from /public/data/.
* Search: minisearch or flexsearch running client-side against a pre-compiled manifest.json.
* Scroll Tracking: Native IntersectionObserver attached to <section> tags with rootMargin: "-20% 0px -70% 0px" to trigger active state in the Left Pane.
* Rendering Optimization: All <TafseerSection> components must apply content-visibility: auto; contain-intrinsic-size: auto 800px; to ensure fast initial paint times on large Surahs while preserving Ctrl+F capability.